.TH FORK-LINUX 1 "" "Fork for Linux (unofficial)" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fork\-linux \- run the official Fork for Windows git client under Wine (unofficial wrapper)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfork\-linux\fR [\fIGLOBAL OPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIARGS\fR]
.br
\fBfork\-linux\fR \fB\-\-version\fR | \fB\-\-help\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fork for Linux (unofficial) runs the official, unmodified Fork for Windows git client under Wine, with a menu entry, a fork command for opening repositories, update snapshots and a health check.
.PP
Fork is proprietary, paid software made by Dan Pristupov and Tanya Pristupova. The evaluation is free; please buy a license at https://git\-fork.com/buy if you keep using it.
.PP
This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by the Fork developers. It downloads the official Fork installer from cdn.fork.dev on your machine and never redistributes, patches or decompiles Fork. Report problems with the wrapper at https://github.com/ventura8/Fork\-Linux/issues.
.PP
The first run sets everything up lazily and resumably: a pinned Wine runtime, a per\-user Wine prefix, Microsoft .NET Framework and the official Fork installer. Nothing is ever written to ~/.wine.
